  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo> </mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. Let a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be such that the angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
